    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> by work energy theorem</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>mag</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi>ele</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>qE</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>qa</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo></math> Rate of work done at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo></math> power of electric force</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>qE</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>dw</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> for both forces</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn><mtext>&#160;v&#160;</mtext><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mtext>&#160;mvak&#160;</mtext><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>mva</mi></math></p>",
